  "cardEffects": "＜Piercing＞ (When this Digimon deletes your opponent's Digimon in battle while attacking, it checks security before the attack ends.)\n＜Vortex＞ (At the end of your turn, this Digimon may attack an opponent's Digimon. With this effect, it can attack the turn it was played.)\n＜Blocker＞ (This Digimon can block in the blocker timing.)\n[When Digivolving] You may unsuspend 1 Digimon. Then, you may suspend 1 Digimon.\n[All Turns] [Once Per Turn] When any of your Digimon suspend, you may play 1 3000 DP or lower green Digimon card with [Avian] or [Bird] in any of its traits from your hand without paying the cost. For each suspended Digimon, add 2000 to this effect's DP maximum.",
